{"reviews":[{"id":"B007Y54ABE-0","r":5.0,"t":"Works great","x":"No complaints. Works well. I use it to clip the side of my nails when doing coffin or stiletto nails.","h":19,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-1","r":1.0,"t":"Just not for me","x":"Unfortunately, the blades don't open wide enough to accommodate my very thick toenails. I would really like to find a straight-cut clipper just like this one that would work on my toenails.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-2","r":1.0,"t":"Worst toenail clipper I\u2019ve ever bought!","x":"The area to fit your toenail into the clipper is entirely too narrow!!! It\u2019s challenging getting your nail into the clipper, and it shouldn\u2019t be! #youhadonejob. Took forever to clip my toenails. Plus, the little piece attached to the shank does not stay in place. Flops around incessantly. I really don\u2019t understand all the good reviews. :(","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-3","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Clippers - Much Better Method","x":"I'm really pleased with this nail clipper and use it for fingernails as well as toenails.  The curved clippers had a tendency to cut too deep around the edge of my nails.  Being a flat clipper, it does leave some corners, but they are knocked off quickly with a nail file. You'd never know your nails were cut with a flat clipper after filing them briefly.  Even with curved clippers, I had to use the nail file to smooth up the nails - so no net difference.  I strongly prefer to use these straight ","h":6,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2015"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-4","r":1.0,"t":"Not Good Clippers!","x":"I purchased two sets of toenail clippers simultaneously to evaluate them:  DENCO and TOOLWORX.  The DENCO clippers did not cut cleanly and left very ragged edges.  The TOOLWORX clippers cut very cleanly and I will be purchasing those going forward instead of the DENCO.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-5","r":4.0,"t":"Bassetts aren't made anymore, so this will do.","x":"This is pretty good.  Sometimes a straight edge is useful, and this will do.  It doesn't have the precision feel that a Bassett clipper has, but it works.  Made in China.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-6","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"I saw some pretty sketchy reviews about them not being big enough for tonails, but I decided to try anyway for the price. I honestly had no problem what so ever. My nails easily fit inside, they were sharp enough to clip right through.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great clippers","x":"I have a hard time gripping most clippers due to diabetes and arthritis. These are easy to operate , cut quick and dont take hardly any pressure to operate. Best easiest and fastest clippers I have used I'm many many years. A+++++","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-8","r":5.0,"t":"Seems fine","x":"What's the deal, you're supposed to cut your toenails straight across but almost all the clippers are curved? Got this because it has a straight blade. It's a standard heavy duty clipper. It works.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-9","r":5.0,"t":"Sharpest I\u2019ve ever had","x":"I was hesitant because of the price and sometimes things look stronger in pictures than they are in real life but these are soo sturdy and sharp. I use them to clip acrylic nails as well as the tips before applying acrylic and they are my go-to now. I definitely recommend this.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-10","r":4.0,"t":"Good","x":"Good for $3.79, but I remember getting the exact same thing from Walgreens or walmart for $1-2, but I can't find straight edge ones in store anymore. It comes with the file which is great for finger nail cleaning but a weak file","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-11","r":4.0,"t":"good straight clippers","x":"Somewhat large and bulky, but work well and give a nice straight edge.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-12","r":4.0,"t":"good straight clippers","x":"Somewhat large and bulky, but work well and give a nice straight edge.","h":3,"v":0,"d":"Jul 2014"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-13","r":5.0,"t":"I can finally cut my toenails straight across!","x":"I\u2019ve been looking for these for years! They are great clippers, they are good and sturdy, and at price no one can beat. I\u2019m so glad I found them.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great","x":"Thanks for making a clipper that does what it should. Great to hold while clipping, like the straight edge. Makes job easier.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-15","r":1.0,"t":"Junk - very dull","x":"These are barely usable to trim my toenails - the edges aren\u2019t sharp enough to produce a clean cut.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-16","r":5.0,"t":"Why do they even make the curved type?","x":"I bought these clippers for my husband and our son who both suffer from ingrown toe nails on the recommendation from my brother-in-law.  he told me that he had bought a pair of straight clippers years ago and if I could ever find a pair to get them and we would never have ingrown toe nails again.  Well I must say the guys are very happy as they work like a charm.  What I didn't realize is how great they would work for myself.  Now I don't get ingrown nails but those curved clippers always left a","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-17","r":5.0,"t":"HAd to have","x":"my husband has a condition with his nails and has to cut them straight edge. only issue, no one has straightedge in stores. found this one day and had to get it. absolutely loves it. super sturdy and a great value.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-18","r":5.0,"t":"Great!","x":"I bought because this particular clipped cuts straight across. Not many do and the curve on others never is like the curve of my nails. These make doing my own pedi much easier..they are very sturdy as well.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-19","r":5.0,"t":"Great little clipper","x":"this clipper is of good quality and perform very well. It is just what I expected when I placed my order. I would recommend this product.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great buy","x":"The quality of these clippers is very good. They are strdy and a great value for the money. I would recommend them.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-21","r":5.0,"t":"Quality","x":"[[VIDEOID:9cdb64d43848984bd9f9c62f4b72c3cc]] It appears to be sturdy. If anything changes I will update the review.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-22","r":5.0,"t":"Much better than \u2018regular\u2019 clippers","x":"Using a straight clipper helps to prevent hangnails which is very painful. I will never use curved clippers again","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-23","r":5.0,"t":"When u want a str8 line these are it","x":"I do my own nails so I don't use a nail trimmer its always uneven but using these clippers str8 to the point","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B007Y54ABE-24","r":5.0,"t":"sharp and works well","x":"These straight edge clippers are so much better than curved ones.  This one is very sharp and easy to use.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the clippers work well and are sturdy, sharp, and easy to use, especially for straight-across cuts.","cites":[1,4,7,8,9,10,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers report the blade opening is too narrow for thick toenails, making clipping difficult.","cites":[2,3]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the clippers are somewhat large and bulky, and one mentions a loose, floppy piece.","cites":[3,12,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention the clippers leave ragged edges or lack precision compared to other brands.","cites":[5,6]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the straight-edge design for toenails and value the low price.","cites":[4,9,11,14,15]}]},"qa":[]}